From e6094d52b0a6fbd70b3ed91e8a2002d6209e9d1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SMARK <3222301373@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Apr 2026 05:03:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: implement daemon lifecycle management and server lock
 handling

- Added a new server lock mechanism to manage daemon processes and prevent multiple instances.
- Implemented graceful shutdown logic for the daemon, including handling SIGTERM and idle timeouts.
- Enhanced tool description resolution with dynamic imports and template variable support.
- Introduced integration tests for the daemon lifecycle, ensuring proper startup, health checks, and shutdown behavior.
- Updated the worker module to handle external server requests and manage internal state more effectively.
- Refactored existing code to improve readability and maintainability, including the removal of unused RPC functionality.

